{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:41c1bfb8b5b00c0a","name":"Droid Manufacturers","source":{"id":"source:reference-41c1bfb8b5b00c0a","title":"Droid Manufacturers","revision":24488,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:25:46Z","sha256":"27613bdc4d273d49e3ac2655ee51c27e0c07729e6e3f03b45afaa0287d670775","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24488","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droid%20Manufacturers&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-41c1bfb8b5b00c0a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Millions of manufacturing companies produce ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},". Most are small companies that cater to local regions, manufacture specialized units, or focus on highly customized models. The major interstellar manufacturers dominate specific markets, although those markets shift as the demands of the galactic government and mega corporations change.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," and the Galactic Civil War, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybot Galactica"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybot_Galactica","referenceId":"reference:8d89ff519236e3e2"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Industrial Automaton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Industrial_Automaton","referenceId":"reference:8ab52c937ff3814a"}," are the dominant manufacturers, with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arakyd Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arakyd_Industries","referenceId":"reference:53475569f2ae9d67"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["MerenData"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MerenData","referenceId":"reference:c09d29dd0bc8cb90"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Serv-O-Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Serv-O-Droid","referenceId":"reference:74ba75c19189ad20"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Veril Line Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Veril_Line_Systems","referenceId":"reference:99d42d8b7aa8c6f7"}," as major players in their respective markets. During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", most Separatist Battle Droids are manufactured by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Baktoid Combat Automata"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baktoid_Combat_Automata","referenceId":"reference:d759d0449434ca4c"}," forces, with other units coming from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Techno Union"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Techno_Union","referenceId":"reference:0fb0faf68ee3e6e2"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Colicoid Creation Nest"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Colicoid_Creation_Nest","referenceId":"reference:512ce3683efd2b56"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Commerce Guild"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Commerce_Guild","referenceId":"reference:9d27b12029ae3f0d"},". However, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," manufacturing has existed for thousands of years. In the time of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},", 4,000 years before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebellion Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebellion_Era"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Czerka Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Czerka_Corporation","referenceId":"reference:cf6b7a4dee7c0713"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duwani Mechanical Products"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duwani_Mechanical_Products","referenceId":"reference:41885578ac879bdf"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aratech Repulsor Company"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aratech_Repulsor_Company?action=edit&redlink=1"}," dominated the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," markets of their day; other well-known manufacturers, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["MerenData"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MerenData","referenceId":"reference:c09d29dd0bc8cb90"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Serv-O-Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Serv-O-Droid","referenceId":"reference:74ba75c19189ad20"},", were also becoming competitive.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although manufacturing plants can be found on both major and lesser worlds, a significant percentage of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," come from either ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechis III"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechis_III","referenceId":"reference:f000f83e31a4379b"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telti"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telti","referenceId":"reference:83d5ffdea6efb2a1"},". These two worlds specialize in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," production to such an extent that their surfaces are essentially covered by automated precision-manufacturing plants. The major manufacturers use these fabrication facilities extensively. Most of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," built in these facilities are shipped by bulk freighter, but light freighter jockeys make a decent living running small orders to isolated regions of the galaxy.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Droid Builders"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["So, you want to know about Droid Manufacturers? Well, l can tell you a few things. First, people have their sentimental favorites. However, as a buyer, it pays to know that Cybot's standard parts are plentiful and inexpensive, while Veriline's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," can take a pounding. The manufacturer is important, but most people buy their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," used, so I think it's more important to know the Droid's recent repair history and if it's been rebuilt with nonstandard parts."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["You want galactic servicing and support? Better buy from the big guys. You want modifications? The authorized shops won't add on unauthorized parts, no matter how useful. Find your local ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," shop- preferably one that specializes in your kind of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". Believe me, you don't want someone learning on your job. They might swear that all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," are the same, but they're not. And you don't need your Battle Droid to suddenly worry about proper etiquette mid-battle."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Always remember, the biggest and best known companies build decent and highly resilient machines, but the best built come from custom ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," shops."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["-",{"tag":"a","children":["Raalo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Raalo?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Droid Manufacturer Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," reflects its manufacturer in many ways- physical design, reliability, signature systems, and even personality traits. Some companies and model lines become known for these attributes, good and bad. Since all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," are also individuals, the influence of such traits varies greatly from unit to unit. A manufacturer's descriptions include typical traits or attributes that apply to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," it manufactures. These traits can be added as a template to any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," manufactured by the company, although their usage is optional in game play.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MANUFACTURER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TRAIT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Arakyd Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arakyd_Industries","referenceId":"reference:53475569f2ae9d67"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Once per day, an Arakyd Droid can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check against a DC equal to its own ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". If the check is successful, the Droid's behavioral inhibitor allows it to take prohibited actions until the forbidden action is completed. After completion, the inhibitor returns to normal functioning.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Baktoid Combat Automata"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baktoid_Combat_Automata","referenceId":"reference:d759d0449434ca4c"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["A character can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check opposed by a Baktoid Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," Skill to attempt to temporarily confuse it with contradictory data or brash, seemingly illogical action. If the check is successful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can take no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," for one round as it tries to find an appropriate response. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check is unsuccessful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," recognizes the ruse and proclaims it loudly while taking an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Balmorran Arms"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Balmorran_Arms","referenceId":"reference:06bdd61590e4c272"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When creating or purchasing a new Balmorran Arms Droid, increase one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Score"}," by 1.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Colicoid Creation Nest"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Colicoid_Creation_Nest","referenceId":"reference:512ce3683efd2b56"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Once per encounter, a Colicoid Droid can ignore all negative penalties from its location on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," when making an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Cybot Galactica"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybot_Galactica","referenceId":"reference:8d89ff519236e3e2"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Cybot systems are so commonplace that nondroid heroes with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Mechanics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Mechanics)"}," can modify or repair Cybot Droids in half the time that would be required for a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Modifying Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Modifying_Droids"},"). This does not stack with any other ability that saves modification or repair time. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," does not gain this benefit when modifying itself.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Czerka Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Czerka_Corporation","referenceId":"reference:cf6b7a4dee7c0713"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["A Czerka Droid can use its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," modifier instead of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier to determine its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," Skill modifier.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Duwani Mechanical Products"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duwani_Mechanical_Products","referenceId":"reference:41885578ac879bdf"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Once per encounter, when it has half or fewer of its maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", a Duwani Droid can either gain 5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," or add 5 to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," for one round.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Holowan Mechanicals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holowan_Mechanicals","referenceId":"reference:aba061e79d377d2b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Once per encounter, a Holowan Droid can add 1 die of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage"}," to an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Department of Military Research"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Department_of_Military_Research","referenceId":"reference:917b93a98d3ed3fe"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Imperial prototypes are constructed with built-in tracking devices and recording equipment to document the Droid's performance. Imperial Droids transmit the data upon command to a central reporting station or, when in the field, to the nearest Imperial installation.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Industrial Automaton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Industrial_Automaton","referenceId":"reference:8ab52c937ff3814a"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check, an Industrial Automaton Droid ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," can add its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," bonus (minimum +1) to the normal +2 bonus.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["MerenData"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MerenData","referenceId":"reference:c09d29dd0bc8cb90"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"},", a MerenData Droid adds its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},". When attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", it adds both its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus and its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," bonus to the check.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Roche"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Roche","referenceId":"reference:8ec195e100fe00a8"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When modifying an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Accessory"},", or a tool or instrument mounted on an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendage"},", apply a +5 circumstance bonus to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Modifying Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Modifying_Droids"},"). This bonus does not apply to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," modifying themselves.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Serv-O-Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Serv-O-Droid","referenceId":"reference:74ba75c19189ad20"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When recharging, Serv-O-Droid Droids can remove one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," that requires repairs to remove per day, moving +1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Tendrando Arms"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tendrando_Arms","referenceId":"reference:32bdf02c837d4e55"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["A Tendrando Arms Droid gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Veril Line Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Veril_Line_Systems","referenceId":"reference:99d42d8b7aa8c6f7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Once per day, a Veriline Droid can make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check to extend its run time by 25 hours or to move +1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
